# Hopping on a ledge's end forever (found measuring the Embarcadero's tiers, phase 25, on the old Pier 7
# benches; since city phase 15 rebuilt Pier 7, on EMB's row of granite ledges, the same kind of ledge, 3 m
# apart): rolled along the row into the end of a ledge, the skater was stopped by it, and a grind press caught the bench at 0.2 m/s
# along it. That grind stalled on its first tick (a void grind), a late ollie popped them straight up
# off it, a flip, the bench caught again: a combo that never landed, 11,275 x11 open after 5 s (49,980
# after 15); these keys: grindStart 13 times on the spot. A catch slower than grind.stallSpeed along the line is no
# grind now (grind.ts tryCapture): the same keys bring the skater down on the ledge, mid-flip.
